    title: 'Delhi to Agra Cab: Direct Drop, Sightseeing Day or Overnight Return',
    metaTitle: 'Delhi–Agra Cab: Drop, Day Tour or Overnight?',
    excerpt: 'Turn your Delhi–Agra travel plan into a clear booking request: compare drop-only, retained sightseeing and overnight return inclusions.',
    city: 'Agra', image: '/images/sightseeing/Agra/Taj_mahal.jpg', tags: ['Delhi', 'Agra', 'Sightseeing'],
    content: `<p class="blog-lead">Before booking a Delhi–Agra cab, choose the service you actually need: an Agra drop, a vehicle retained for sightseeing and the return, or an overnight arrangement. Put that choice into the written request. This checklist focuses on what the booking should contain, rather than repeating a route guide or quoting fares that may not match your journey.</p>
${table('Three bookings that should not be confused', ['Service','Typical request','Key detail to confirm'], [
['Direct drop','Delhi address to one Agra drop point','Whether any intermediate stop is included'],
['Sightseeing and return','Agra stops plus return to Delhi','Waiting, local movement and latest return plan'],
['Overnight return','Hotel drop, later sightseeing and return','Chargeable days, local use and driver arrangements']])}
${section('Write the destination as an actual address', `<p>“Agra” might mean a hotel, a meeting, a railway connection or a sightseeing starting point. Give the exact address and final drop requirement. If you are travelling from an airport, include the flight details and time needed to be ready for pickup. If you are catching a service after the return, make that constraint visible before agreeing the itinerary.</p><p>Begin with the <a href="/delhi-to-agra">Delhi to Agra cab page</a>. Ask the operator to quote the selected service rather than asking for a generic cab price and adding the day's stops afterwards. That makes it easier to compare what is included.</p>`)}
${section('For a sightseeing day, specify vehicle availability', `<p>List the places you want to visit in order and mark any optional stop. Ask where the vehicle will wait, how you will meet the driver again and whether entry tickets or a guide are separate. A sightseeing cab provides road transport; it should not be assumed to include admission, queues, a guide or access directly to every entrance.</p><p>Check the day before fixing a Taj Mahal visit. The <a href="https://tajmahal.gov.in/">official Taj Mahal website</a> states that it is closed on Fridays for general viewing. Confirm current visitor instructions when arranging tickets. The <a href="/sightseeing/agra-full-day-city-tour">Agra full-day city tour</a> is a useful way to discuss the sightseeing portion explicitly.</p>`)}
${section('For an overnight stay, identify the handovers', `<p>Write down when the vehicle drops you at the hotel, whether it remains available afterwards and when the next pickup begins. A night in Agra does not automatically mean unlimited driving on both days. Confirm the chargeable-day calculation, driver allowance, parking and any minimum-distance rule in the quotation.</p><p>Ask whether bags can stay in the vehicle during a stop and what arrangement applies during the hotel stay. Keep essential belongings with you. If you intend to finish at a different Delhi address or continue elsewhere, include that final destination before the booking is priced.</p>`)}
${section('Compare quotes using the same columns', `<p>Make a short comparison with vehicle category, pickup and final drop, stops, included hours or days, distance basis, waiting, tolls, parking and exclusions. Ask for a clear total or an explanation of which components remain payable at actuals. Two quotes are not comparable when one covers only the outward journey and the other retains the vehicle throughout.</p><p>The existing <a href="/blog/delhi-to-agra-complete-travel-playbook-2026">Delhi–Agra travel playbook</a> covers broader journey choices. Use this article's checklist to turn your chosen plan into a precise request rather than collecting another generic itinerary.</p>`)}
${section('Copy a booking brief', `<blockquote><p>Pickup [Delhi address/date/time]. Passengers and bags [details]. Service [drop/day tour/overnight]. Agra stops [required and optional]. Hotel [if staying]. Final drop [address/date]. Please confirm vehicle availability between stops, all charge components, exclusions and change terms.</p></blockquote><p>Before paying, resolve every blank that could change the vehicle's working time. Keep the final itinerary and quote together so changes can be compared with the original agreement.</p>`)}
${faq([['Does a Delhi–Agra drop include Taj Mahal sightseeing?','Only if it is explicitly included. Request the sightseeing stop, waiting and onward drop when booking.'],['Can I decide to stay overnight after arrival?','It depends on vehicle and driver availability. Ask the operator to confirm the revised arrangement and price before extending.']])}`,
